    {
      "title": "Australia news live: Victoria attorney general nominates for state Labor leadership in heated meeting after Jacinta Allan quits as premier",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/jul/28/jacinta-allan-victoria-labor-leadership-spill-ben-carroll-challenge-antisemitism-royal-commission-nsw-icac-inquiry-queensland-estimates-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Allan urges women not to be discouraged from politics as she quits as Victorian premier<strong>. </strong>Follow updates live</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/jul/28/jacinta-allan-resigns-quits-victoria-premier-leadership-challenge-ben-carroll\">Jacinta Allan resigns as Victorian premier before leadership challenge by Ben Carroll</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/jul/27/who-is-ben-carroll-mp-victoria-deputy-premier-faction-jacinta-allan\">Who is Ben Carroll?</a></p></li><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p><strong>ACTU president says now is the ‘right time’ to leave</strong></p><p><strong>Michele O’Neil, </strong>the president of the Australian Council of Trade Unions, said it’s the “right time” to leave after she announced her departure alongside ACTU secretary <strong>Sally McManus</strong>.</p><p>We thought about this and we just think that it’s time for renewal. The union movement is in good shape. We’ve seen changes in workers’ rights that have made a big difference in workers’ lives. We’ve seen the union movement starting to grow for the first time in decades. And next year will be the 100th anniversary of the ACTU. <strong>So we think it’s time for a new leadership team to come in.</strong></p><p>We have a debt heading towards $200bn in this state. We have teachers out striking in the streets because the state government and <strong>Ben Carroll</strong> can’t secure a pay deal. We have holes in the roads. You need a majority government to fix those problems, and you need someone with a plan.</p><p>Now he might performatively call a royal commission tokenistically, now that he’s become leader, but that’s not out of sincere concern about corruption. That’s out of sincere concern about the polls and what that means for Victorian Labor.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/jul/28/jacinta-allan-victoria-labor-leadership-spill-ben-carroll-challenge-antisemitism-royal-commission-nsw-icac-inquiry-queensland-estimates-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-07-28T01:11:17"
    },
    {
      "title": "PM praises Sally McManus and Michele O’Neil as ‘giants’ as they resign from ACTU",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/jul/28/sally-mcmanus-michele-oneil-resign-actu-union-leaders",
      "description": "<p>Secretary and president of Australian Council of Trade Unions announced surprise departures on Monday evening</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/jul/28/jacinta-allan-victoria-labor-leadership-spill-ben-carroll-challenge-antisemitism-royal-commission-nsw-icac-inquiry-queensland-estimates-ntwnfb\">Follow our Australia news live blog for latest updates</a></p></li><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>The leadership of the trade union movement is set for a major shakeup after the secretary and president of the Australian Council of Trade Unions announced their surprise departures.</p><p>The ACTU’s secretary, Sally McManus, and its president, Michele O’Neil, revealed on Monday night they would be stepping down after eight years together. Anthony Albanese described both as personal friends and “giants of the labour movement”.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/jul/28/sally-mcmanus-michele-oneil-resign-actu-union-leaders\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-07-28T00:34:52"
    },
    {
      "title": "Who is Ben Carroll, the man about to become Victoria’s next premier?",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/jul/27/who-is-ben-carroll-mp-victoria-deputy-premier-faction-jacinta-allan",
      "description": "<p>Carroll, who was elected to parliament in 2012 and says he has always been ambitious, had emerged as Allan’s only contender for the leadership on Monday</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/jul/28/jacinta-allan-victoria-labor-leadership-spill-ben-carroll-challenge-antisemitism-royal-commission-nsw-icac-inquiry-queensland-estimates-ntwnfb\">LIVE: Jacinta Allan resigns as premier of Victoria</a></p></li><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>In 2023, when then-public transport minister Ben Carroll failed in his surprising bid to secure the leadership of the Victorian Labor party, he told a press conference: “I was always very keen to rise.”</p><p>The premier Daniel Andrews had resigned, believing he had locked in his succession plan: his loyal deputy <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2023/sep/27/new-victoria-premier-jacinta-allan-who-is-career-faction-labor-daniel-andrews-resignation\">Jacinta Allan as premier</a>, and treasurer Tim Pallas as deputy.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/jul/27/who-is-ben-carroll-mp-victoria-deputy-premier-faction-jacinta-allan\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-07-28T00:22:41"
    },
    {
      "title": "Jacinta Allan resigns as Victorian premier ahead of leadership challenge by Ben Carroll",
